<http://data.silknow.org/object/32ea4357-cf15-3942-ac9d-a6815c6a9709>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Brocade in polychrome silks on an ivory-colored ground in compound weave. Floral arrangements with slices of citrus fruits. Composed of two pieces, each with a selvedge on one side of six cords and three narrow stripes. Two pieces sewn together along the selvedges to make a piece rounded on one end and straight on the other. Soiled, slightly worn."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/357c8a85-9a5c-302f-a4bf-9b6eea591501> ;
